<title>LEBANON: Lebanon weekly t-bill issue results delayed.</title>
<headline>Lebanon weekly t-bill issue results delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The results of Lebanon's weekly treasury bill issue have been delayed until Tuesday from Monday when they are usually announced, a finance ministry official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The delay was due to technical reasons.</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 353078 861723</p>
</text>
